        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-20T04:14:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm curious about why Sectors are Sectors and not something else. &nbsp;The only one we've seen (Oothagos Expanse) has a planet and moon on the panel art, but its name seems to suggest the panel represents the sector as a whole, not any particular planet or moon. &nbsp;However, you go to the Expanse to pick up Station cards, not Sector cards. &nbsp;Will the Sector cards have some art or flavor text describing the station or moon within the Sector where we're picking up the Station cards?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:06.661Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
